d": "1539481717547452", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827646_1539481720880785_2513518946274976374_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GwSg24Tg91YQ7kNvwEzneH4&_nc_oc=AdqsOolnv1Xv_V3HMDUljVYFRMehNrNp_AzeewAQVO3nLrCnpki7SxOEsxMM8oVLS1I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTVQoUk8xskh54T0g59maZRkplTXZZ6GT3xpFcOcW8dDg&oe=6AFB4238"}, {"file_name": "Still008_2.png", "id": "25112198295114272", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820496_25112198301780938_1077255603028702338_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MZ0FEqNbpfcQ7kNvwHYSO4U&_nc_oc=AdoL5mR-CWIgQ_2UCap_uW1frm7bvL28fFfsV2Ig_VEdCqJg_JOMr4-Ph0188LcaQYs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRHLe1XdBKfBVQck8ic-EEXjePLk9NL3oOZ3FGbgfUOgQ&oe=6AFB37CD"}, {"file_name": "SC enhance 2.png", "id": "819404537776802", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827567_819404541110135_6720111309694464700_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8PRjqVB9OIYQ7kNvwFZ_s_r&_nc_oc=AdrYddHp271xTC9Lba08vBs4Im2rnm2cGMEXwvr6cU2TFQrycIrpJDXHY1BQ-D6qR5E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRP0_LRHWnIYes9k2Jjjk5zRA6TSOvRoFC5Az4V8IQTaw&oe=6AFB1F6A"}, {"file_name": "SoS_Screenshot_stupidgun.png", "id": "4379721818926228", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_4379721822259561_1390301935121649003_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cwUHp7yCYSAQ7kNvwE8Ihjy&_nc_oc=AdoWfFJrvp3UDUlS6rDgFVna8P2RGfeNZhOLdLDlkakaLBGI3Wy8WwDMQSNp5KJAvcs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQKsDQ75HQc9grUHhcSU69zowDURV8wJaK18RwlAg64_g&oe=6AFB26C1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SoS 2026 Keyart Landscape.png", "id": "1833213617833161", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_1833213621166494_384400314837759898_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6RlcTLrfqgQQ7kNvwErt4UO&_nc_oc=AdoaBIetzSlQgcc4GGf2sP1CHdgcBwPefXy6WrvObJ1tBClXiXKgt4CHIdk19cAT1F8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS_ozJF6lJ6CDDS4kQObevOzescWPfjna3G-yhIx2cmSw&oe=6AFB3AA2"}, "display_name": "Scan or Scam - Cashier Simulator", "keywords": ["job", "simulator", "security", "airport", "shop"], "long_description": "# NEW MULTIPLAYER OPEN BETA!!\ud83d\udc65\n\nEnjoy Scan or Scam with your friends and become the best cashier in town.\n\nIn multiplayer, 2 to 6 players compete to earn the most money from a shared set of customers. When the rush ends, the richest cashier wins.\n\nAnd if fast scanning is not enough, use the Grabber to steal items straight from your neighbors\u2019 conveyor belts.\n\nPlease note that multiplayer is still in beta access and may contain bugs.\nFeel free to give us feedback on Discord, it is greatly appreciated!\n\n# Join our discord and become a launcher!\n\nhttps://discord.gg/TKAhFrUjcq\n\n# Scan, weigh, sell! \ud83d\uded2\nWelcome to the checkout counter! Scan items, weigh fruits and veggies, stock your display, and run your shop like a pro \ud83d\udc54\n\n{2272372933251341}\n\nBuy and resell shady items \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\nSketchy customers will offer you strange goods. Negotiate the right price, resell them on the sly, and rake in the cash without raising suspicion \ud83d\udc40\n\n{633456286446869}\n\nStay out of trouble \ud83d\ude93\nThe cops stop by from time to time, so make sure to hide illegal items under the counter or risk a hefty fine \u26a0\ufe0f\n\n{3754821571493149}\n\nKeep Karen in line \ud83d\ude08\nIf a customer is bothering you, who\u2019s going to stop you from making sure they never come back?\n\n{812770195097022}\n\nUpgrade your shop \ud83d\udc8e\nInvest your cash to improve your store and sell even more crazy stuff.\n\n{1540407727166959}\n\nCollect brainrots \ud83e\udde0\nBuy eggs containing brainrot figures. Keep them, or sell them for a high price.\n\n{1179001034350128}\n\nFood services \ud83c\udf2d\nYour convenience store now also serves food and drinks.\n\n{2323574244813280}", "short_description": "Welcome to the checkout counter! Make as much money as possible and be the best store in town! Even if it means selling special candies \ud83d\udc8a, exotic produce \ud83e\udde0, or solving customer problems with wisdom, or not!\n\nScan, scam\u2026 and beware of the cops \ud83d\udc6e\u200d\u2642\ufe0f!\n\nThink the solo checkout lane was chaotic? Now there\u2019s multiplayer.\n\nUp to 6 players per lobby\nA Race against the clock to ring up as many items as possible\nOut-earn every other cashier by any means necessary, any. \nNew weapon: THE GRABBER!!"}]}, "developer_name": "Kalank Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.arianestudios.com/scan-or-scam-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ariane Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.arianestudios.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29359813323602608"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_109403212349296