etless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SWLwAS2netkQ7kNvwFCXbfX&_nc_oc=AdonUa7dX3GoHTss4OT9Uf102pt2kf3YBO_sbav9IAPDdN2rGcyW9JBNVGY09aiisdI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSjPy_75E0jEwKw9xmmIlQdTeSbO2AcGMDERywKs-BGYA&oe=6AFB1902"}]}, "id": "3196297860528562", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Screenshot 19.png", "id": "1140633197983557", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819464_1140633201316890_2927263675223498983_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xXiusESOY1IQ7kNvwHip_F2&_nc_oc=AdrEv4S4Mj5FiSyF806HYNL4EmrUh0ecER306yqSlJZ8c8RZ-MQqjuZRCctDtg0A0tw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQGgtuFbD3HACAlbSILcYBudlbMdEhEu6iOOTE5K2ZMww&oe=6AFB44D9"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 18.png", "id": "1291160029465965", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822723_1291160036132631_2719206691170228807_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nB99ujAXsbMQ7kNvwF8h9Rg&_nc_oc=AdpJc4pRCS1FA65n1OrUbSe10kxhflXK2x5WZP_stieXsc53Xz1be1_4M8JlAJhCiqU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR0zKXLrfpSqKrAHye7jkB76h9IcrgiWdHRKUFu7HChGg&oe=6AFB4B95"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 14.png", "id": "751809724356963", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819980_751809727690296_6551419684844024027_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ulVfoi9Llh4Q7kNvwF1d_s6&_nc_oc=Adomu8sLU4h-sW2iy-IpLnFY0W6oXCwrFul7ZDwLIuhVOzVZSjcJ-eHYfvnli44TLFc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRi9adZqU19AGR8ITq70Oc3zElESazKQjRRMODB8bycCA&oe=6AFB37F5"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2.png", "id": "3957571567829572", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295661_3957571571162905_4034787827945005360_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rLHquVe4BAMQ7kNvwGxtWNz&_nc_oc=AdoyMB-FkY1-Xli7x3oXL4i4GMiJpE-2QceJWhDiEPN644-pcniv7hQirUOD9a1SIGI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSvlGEMzBmpKLTTiZsO5jazHSusRHgmNMTUU038Xngj-w&oe=6AFB25EC"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 9.png", "id": "1341360194022510", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1341360197355843_3964022283179213098_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sxlTGjw-uOoQ7kNvwF2bags&_nc_oc=Ado5S2qGaHB8Pm_qZpzADwSzIij3aBC7B2QsalmVENSZbBF5WqvHrgCC5B8dWyX3IO8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRepHlrzHuq7N1iCfdPQD2StN8MS_oi2Qh3pQayyC4A_w&oe=6AFB40B5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Scan or Scam", "keywords": ["cops", "cashier", "store", "shop", "customer"], "long_description": "# Scan, weigh, sell! \ud83d\uded2\nWelcome to the checkout counter! Scan the items customers bring up with your scanner \ud83d\udce6\ud83d\udd14, weigh fruits and veggies \ud83e\udd5d\u2696\ufe0f, show off products in the display \ud83e\uddc3\u2728\u2026 and run your shop like a pro! \ud83d\udc54\n{1490639475692321}\n# Buy and resell shady items \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\nSome sketchy customers \ud83e\udd28 will offer you strange goods \ud83d\udcbc. Negotiate the right price \ud83d\udcac\ud83d\udcb8, resell them on the sly \ud83e\udd2b\u2026 and rake in the cash \ud83d\udcb5 without raising suspicion \ud83d\udc40.\n{2427915054269242}\n# Stay out of trouble with the law \ud83d\ude93\nEvery now and then, the cops swing by for a donut \ud83c\udf69\ud83d\udc6e. Make sure to hide any sketchy items \ud83e\udde8 under the counter \ud83e\ude91\u2026 or you\u2019ll be slapped with a hefty fine \u26a0\ufe0f\ud83d\udcb8!\n{1532530688103191}\n# Kick thieves out and keep your clients in line \ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1\nWhen you see a thief \ud83e\uddb9, grab any tools \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f you\u2019d like to make sure they\u2019re not getting away with money \ud83d\udcb0. Oh, and if you want to use some of these tools on the other clients \ud83d\ude08, who\u2019s going to stop you?\n{2009395116480515}\n# Pay the gangster to keep your store open \ud83d\udcbc\ud83d\udd25\nFrom time to time, the mafia chef \ud83c\udf5d\ud83d\ude0e will come to your store to collect fees for\u2026 let\u2019s say \u201cprotection\u201d \ud83d\udcb5fees! You HAVE to pay him, otherwise, it\u2019s GAME (life) OVER \u2620\ufe0f. Make sure you always have the money \ud83d\udcb0!\n{1176581877704574}", "short_description": "Welcome to the checkout counter! Make as much money as possible and be the best store in town! Even if it means selling special candies \ud83d\udc8a, exotic produce \ud83e\udde0, or solving customer problems with wisdom or not.\nBeware of the cops \ud83d\udc6e\u200d\u2642\ufe0f, the thieves \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f, and especially the mafia boss \ud83d\udd76\ufe0f who might come to claim his share.\n\nScan, scam\u2026 or it\u2019s game over! \u2620\ufe0f"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1864576667429230", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Scan or Scam", "keywords": ["simulation", "fun", "sandbox", "casual", "famille"], "long_description": "# Scanne, p\u00e8se, vends ! \ud83d\uded2\u2696\ufe0f\nBienvenue derri\u00e8re la caisse ! Scanne les articles que les clients d\u00e9posent \ud83d\udce6, p\u00e8se les fruits et l\u00e9gumes \ud83c\udf4e\u2696\ufe0f, propose des produits en vitrine \ud83e\uddc3\u2728\u2026 et fais tourner ton commerce comme un pro \ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83d\udcbc.\n{31363126070001679}\n# Ach\u00e8te et revends des objets louches \ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\nDes clients un peu suspects \ud83e\udd28 viendront te proposer des objets \u00e9tranges \ud83d\udcbc. Marchande au bon prix \ud83d\udcac\ud83d\udcb8, revends discr\u00e8tement \ud83e\udd2b\u2026 et fais-toi un max de cash \ud83d\udcb5 sans \u00e9veiller les soup\u00e7ons \ud83d\udc40.\n{1449403412844013}\n# \u00c9vite les ennuis avec la loi \ud83d\ude93\nParfois, les flics d\u00e9barquent pour acheter un donut \ud83c\udf69\ud83d\udc6e. Cache les objets douteux \ud83e\udde8 sous le comptoir \ud83e\ude91\u2026 sinon, c\u2019est l\u2019amende sal\u00e9e \u26a0\ufe0f\ud83d\udcb8 !\n{4536557793238800}\n# Mettez les voleurs \u00e0 la porte et gardez vos clients en ligne \ud83d\udeaa\ud83d\udc62\nQuand vous apercevez un voleur \ud83e\uddb9, utilisez les outils \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f que vous voulez pour vous assurer qu'il ne vous prenne pas d'argent \ud83d\udcb0. Oh, et si vous voulez utiliser certains de ces outils sur les autres clients \ud83d\ude08, qui vous en emp\u00eachera ?\n{1302072421597369}\n# Payez le gangster pour garder votre magasin ouvert \ud83d\udcbc\ud83d\udd25\nDe temps \u00e0 autre, le chef de la mafia \ud83c\udf5d\ud83d\ude0e vient dans votre magasin pour collecter des frais pour\u2026 disons la \u00ab protection \u00bb \ud83d\udcb5cotisation ! Vous DEVEZ le payer, sinon, c'est GAME OVER \u2620\ufe0f. Assurez-vous d'avoir l'argent \ud83d\udcb6 !\n{697305622716796}", "short_description": "Gagne un maximum d'argent \ud83d\udcb0 et g\u00e8re ta boutique comme un pro \ud83d\udc54 ! M\u00eame si \u00e7a implique de vendre\u2026 des compl\u00e9ments alimentaires \ud83d\udc8a, des produits exotiques \ud83e\udde0, ou de r\u00e9gler les probl\u00e8mes des clients avec sagesse et maturit\u00e9 ou pas.\nAttention aux flics \ud83d\udc6e\u200d\u2642\ufe0f, aux voleurs \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f, et surtout au parrain de la mafia \ud83d\udd76\ufe0f qui pourrait venir r\u00e9clamer sa part.\nScanne, arnaque\u2026 ou c\u2019est game over \u2620\ufe0f !"}]}, "developer_name": "Touch Grass Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.arianestudios.com/scan-or-scam-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ariane Studios", "support_website_url": null, "webs